    "modifier_pangolier_17_0": "New Active Ability: Roll Up \n\n The hero rolls up into a motionless protective ball, gaining immunity to effects and +60% magic resistance, but does not lose the ability to turn. This ability can be used during Rolling Thunder to temporarily slow down. Both Rolling Thunder and Shield Crash can be used during Roll Up. Attacking a hero while he's curled up will cause him to roll away from attackers, dealing the same damage and stun as Rolling Thunder. \n\n Duration: 2.75 sec. \n Roll Duration from Attack: 0.75 sec.",
    "modifier_pangolier_17_1": "New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Roll Up</font></b> \n\n The hero rolls up into a motionless protective ball, gaining immunity to effects and +60% magic resistance, but does not lose the ability to turn. This ability can be used during Rolling Thunder to temporarily slow down. Both Rolling Thunder and Shield Crash can be used during Roll Up. Attacking a hero while he's curled up will cause him to roll away from attackers, dealing the same damage and stun as Rolling Thunder. \n\n Duration: 2.75 sec. \n Roll Duration from Attack: 0.75 sec.",
